{"name": "Orcania: Curtain", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/862580d7bff6d7540ad04c4e94722da4.avif?t=1786700720\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a fugitive test subject who has escaped from a research facility. Venture into the other side of the world \u2014 a hidden realm steeped in oppression and fear. Search for a way to cure the affliction that plagues you, uncover the full picture of this world piece by piece, and fight a wide variety of enemies along the way. Expose the conspiracy of the Curtain, and discover the truth behind the manifestation of the human Soul Manifest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/2bf5f7211c3d4eb8a22fd5388d5242b7.poster.avif?t=1786700720\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/2bf5f7211c3d4eb8a22fd5388d5242b7.webm?t=1786700720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/2bf5f7211c3d4eb8a22fd5388d5242b7.mp4?t=1786700720\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras_big/8a109db30b32f5c994c5c4c87594b3ec.webp?t=1786700720\" height=\"146\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/8a109db30b32f5c994c5c4c87594b3ec.avif?t=1786700720\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combining traditional RPG-style skill trees with in-run roguelite builds, this system allows you to strengthen your party through both meta-progression and in-run choices\u2014growing stronger with every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/c1ad98ffac8530044845c07f43812fe1.poster.avif?t=1786700720\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/c1ad98ffac8530044845c07f43812fe1.webm?t=1786700720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/c1ad98ffac8530044845c07f43812fe1.mp4?t=1786700720\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras_big/6c96a0780e650ab0e93d97bd3b27bccb.webp?t=1786700720\" height=\"146\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/6c96a0780e650ab0e93d97bd3b27bccb.avif?t=1786700720\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience exploration like never before. Each expedition brings new challenges \u2014 enemies will adapt and obstruct you in different ways, yet every step brings you closer to the truth. Special events await, too. The hidden world is ever-changing and full of surprises... Make the most of your squad's strengths and rise to every challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/43082dfbf01e94df01e4ae6f73239d7e.poster.avif?t=1786700720\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/43082dfbf01e94df01e4ae6f73239d7e.webm?t=1786700720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/43082dfbf01e94df01e4ae6f73239d7e.mp4?t=1786700720\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/7aff0e2054a7000694471875ce953644.avif?t=1786700720\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The inhabitants of the hidden world \u2014 some are friends, some are foes, and then there are the Orcanian Animech from beyond the stars. The hidden world has many facets waiting for you to explore. Walk with them through wind and rain, until the storm subsides and the clouds part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/86d036a9ba3aa335da6b7edae42c94c4.poster.avif?t=1786700720\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/86d036a9ba3aa335da6b7edae42c94c4.webm?t=1786700720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/86d036a9ba3aa335da6b7edae42c94c4.mp4?t=1786700720\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"146\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/74f52ea7fe45b73f62cb41d5572ad1a5.avif?t=1786700720\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has around 50 unique skill tree options to invest in, along with over a hundred different pieces of Gnosis. Freely build your squad's combat style and assemble a team powerful enough to tear through the entire hidden world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/f4e9ca147c81465b11819adb3a7977b3.poster.avif?t=1786700720\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/f4e9ca147c81465b11819adb3a7977b3.webm?t=1786700720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/extras/f4e9ca147c81465b11819adb3a7977b3.mp4?t=1786700720\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Fight alongside adorable Animech and Therian allies. Confront the dark side of the Hidden Society. Experience roguelite tactical combat, deep main and side stories, and hundreds of traits and equipment to build your team. Uncover the truth buried deep in the hidden world.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330580/header.jpg?t=1786700720", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "RPG", "Tactical RPG", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Strategy RPG", "Adventure"], "developers": "Hemera Starswirl", "publishers": "Hemera Starswirl", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3330580", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "13 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/LLGsNzjwO5g", "first_seen": 17